config REGULATOR_QCOM_PM660L_LCDB
	tristate "Qualcomm PM660L LCDB regulator"
	depends on MFD_SPMI_PMIC
	depends on OF
	help
	  This driver supports the PM660L LCD bias/boost block. The block
	  exposes separate positive LDO and negative NCP regulator outputs
	  which share a boost converter and module enable control.
